00:09:11.000 --> 00:09:30.000
So the people came back, the council people came back in, sat down, picked up the first thing on there, start paging through this. Where did this come from? I don't know where it came from. The containment plan was enough of a compromise that somehow, amazingly, it won out. It wasn't know where it came from. The containment plan was enough of a compromise that somehow, amazingly, it won out. It wasn't a legally binding agreement, but it went on to define the
所以人们回来了，议员们回来了，坐下，拿起上面的第一件事，开始翻阅。这是从哪来的？我不知道它是从哪来的。遏制计划是一个足够的妥协，以至于不知何故，令人惊讶地，它胜出了。它不是一份具有法律约束力的协议，但它后来定义了

