When the Skid Row resident enters the buffer, the psychological comfort of the familiar Skid Row environment will be lost. He will feel foreign and will not be inclined to travel far from the area of containment. and will not be inclined to travel far from the area of containment. After the containment policy was officially adopted in 1976, the city started to implement it, including many of the meticulous and uncomfortable suggestions of how exactly to contain Skid Row's population, like the buffer zone.
“当斯基德罗居民进入缓冲区时，熟悉的斯基德罗环境带来的心理舒适感就会丧失。他会感到陌生，不会倾向于从遏制区域走得太远。”而且不会倾向于从遏制区域走得太远。在1976年正式通过“遏制政策”后，市政府开始实施它，包括许多关于如何精确遏制斯基德罗人口的细致且令人不舒服的建议，比如缓冲区。

